{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"mutating"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"decode"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"input"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"inout"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF32O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt32V7ElementRtzlF1IL_xmfp","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s21UnicodeDecodingResultO","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UnicodeDecodingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UnicodeDecodingResult"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:St","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"IteratorProtocol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"I"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:St7ElementQa","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/IteratorProtocol\/Element"},{"kind":"text","text":" == "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt32V","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"UInt32","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/UInt32"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An iterator of code units to be decoded. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"input"},{"type":"text","text":" must be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the same iterator instance in repeated calls to this method. Do not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"advance the iterator or any copies of the iterator outside this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"input"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Return Value","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance, representing the next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Unicode scalar, an indication of an error, or an indication that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"UTF sequence has been fully decoded.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"To decode a code unit sequence completely, call this method repeatedly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"until it returns ","type":"text"},{"code":"UnicodeDecodingResult.emptyInput","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Checking that the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iterator was exhausted is not sufficient, because the decoder can store","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"buffered data from the input iterator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Because of buffering, it is impossible to find the corresponding position","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in the iterator for a given returned ","type":"text"},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or an error.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example decodes the UTF-16 encoded bytes of a string","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"into an array of ","type":"text"},{"code":"Unicode.Scalar","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instances. This is a demonstration","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"only—if you need the Unicode scalar representation of a string, use","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its ","type":"text"},{"code":"unicodeScalars","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" view.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["\/\/ UTF-32 representation of \"✨Unicode✨\"","let codeUnits: [UTF32.CodeUnit] =","        [10024, 85, 110, 105, 99, 111, 100, 101, 10024]","","var codeUnitIterator = codeUnits.makeIterator()","var scalars: [Unicode.Scalar] = []","var utf32Decoder = UTF32()","Decode: while true {","    switch utf32Decoder.decode(&codeUnitIterator) {","    case .scalarValue(let v): scalars.append(v)","    case .emptyInput: break Decode","    case .error:","        print(\"Decoding error\")","        break Decode","    }","}","print(scalars)","\/\/ Prints \"[\"\\u{2728}\", \"U\", \"n\", \"i\", \"c\", \"o\", \"d\", \"e\", \"\\u{2728}\"]\""],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Unicode\/UTF32\/decode(_:)-swift.method","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"metadata":{"title":"decode(_:)","externalID":"s:s7UnicodeO5UTF32O6decodeys0A14DecodingResultOxzStRzs6UInt32V7ElementRtzlF","symbolKind":"method","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"macOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"decode","kind":"id